# Testing

Put `*_test.go` beside the code. Run `cd backend && go test ./...`.

A good test calls the HTTP API and asserts the status, the envelope, `stock_state`, `inventory_age`, `is_aging`, and `error_code`. It sets a fixed UTC clock.

| Change | Cover |
|--------|--------|
| Aging | Age 0 is not aging. 90 days in stock is not aging. 91 is. Stocked-out age stops on `stocked_out_on` and is not aging |
| Stock-out | The row stays stocked out. The same VIN conflicts. Clearing `stocked_out_on` conflicts |
| VIN | Unique, including against stocked-out rows. Immutable after record. URL id stays |
| Commands | Stock-out and proposed action are rejected on the wrong route |

Check the screen against this API. Do not add a second suite that repeats the same rules in React.
